[D] Is clearance forced at a SMALL/structured D (vs needing the full pair-search)?
    Test: for covering minimizers, what is the M-attaining D? bounded by what?
  over 400 covering sets: M-attaining D ranges; max D = 215
    max-D case: S=[2, 8, 11, 14, 15, 17, 21, 24, 27, 59, 78, 105, 110] M=12/43 D=215
    most common attaining D: [(47, 14), (31, 12), (33, 11), (25, 10), (41, 10), (38, 9), (17, 9), (19, 8), (24, 8), (123, 7)]
  Conclusion line printed at end.

DONE.
